{"type":"message","id":"591a5050","parentId":"1be3d7e1","timestamp":"2026-03-25T06:35:30.524Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tried these URLs:\n- `/inventory/new` — blank page\n- `/inventory/add` — 404\n- `/products` — 404\n- `/product-catalog` — not found\n\nThe inventory system appears to be a single-page app (SPA). The \"Add Item\" button likely opens a modal/drawer client-side rather than navigating to a new URL.\n\nLet me try one more approach — checking if we can trigger the modal through JavaScript by looking at what the button does:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"ollama_call_8c4cb9f0-cf67-4621-a89a-028bfedf9b9b","name":"browser","arguments":{"javaScript":"// Log all buttons and their event listeners\nconst buttons = document.querySelectorAll('button');\nconst buttonInfo = [];\nbuttons.forEach((btn, i) => {\n  const text = btn.innerText || btn.textContent;\n  if (text.includes('Add') || text.includes('Item')) {\n    buttonInfo.push({\n      index: i,\n      text: text.trim(),\n      className: btn.className,\n      hasOnClick: !!btn.onclick,\n      dataAttributes: Object.keys(btn.dataset)\n    });\n  }\n});\nreturn buttonInfo;","targetId":"8B969D166911DCC997C462C5D60F607B","url":"https://infinbiz.com/inventory","action":"navigate"}}],"stopReason":"toolUse","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"kimi-k2.5:cloud","usage":{"input":33736,"output":446,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34182,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"timestamp":1774420530523}}
